ns, which by their nature are intended to survive the termination or expiration of this Agreement to fulfill their essential purpose, will survive the termination or expiration of this Agreement, including: Section 4 (AI Model Services), Section 5 (Payment Terms), Section 8 (Intellectual Property Rights and Permissions; Feedback), Section 10 (Confidential Information), Section 11.5 (Effect of Termination), Section 12 (Additional Representations and Warranties), Section 13 (Disclaimer of Warranties), Section 14 (Limitation of Liability), Section 15 (Indemnification), Section 16 (Dispute Resolution; Governing Law and Venue), Section 17 (Miscellaneous), and Section 18 (Resold Customers).\"]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"99:[\"$\",\"br\",null,{}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"9a:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm my-3\",\"children\":[\"17.10 \",[\"$\",\"em\",null,{\"children\":\"Entire Agreement\"}],\". This Agreement sets out all terms agreed between the parties and supersedes all other agreements between the parties relating to its subject matter. In entering into this Agreement, neither party has relied on, and neither party will have any right or remedy based on, any statement, representation, or warranty (whether made negligently or innocently), except those expressly stated in this Agreement. The URL Terms and Order Form(s) are incorporated by reference into this Agreement. After the Effective Date, Groq may provide an updated URL in place of any URL in this Agreement. Customer agrees that any terms and conditions contained in any purchase order Customer sends to Groq will not apply to this Agreement and are null and void.\"]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"9b:[\"$\",\"br\",null,{}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"9c:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm my-3\",\"children\":[\"17.11 \",[\"$\",\"em\",null,{\"children\":\"Conflicting Terms.\"}],\" If there is a conflict among the documents that make up the Agreement, then the documents will control in the following order (of decreasing precedence) as relevant to the subject matter of the conflict: the \",[\"$\",\"$Lca\",null,{\"prefetch\":true,\"href\":\"/docs/legal/customer-data-processing-addendum\",\"children\":\"DPA\"}],\", the \",[\"$\",\"$Lca\",null,{\"prefetch\":true,\"href\":\"/docs/legal/customer-business-associate-addendum\",\"children\":\"BAA\"}],\", the \",[\"$\",\"$Lca\",null,{\"prefetch\":true,\"href\":\"/docs/legal/ai-policy\",\"children\":\"AUP\"}],\", this Agreement, the applicable Order Form, and then the AI Model Terms.\"]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"9d:[\"$\",\"br\",null,{}]\n9e:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm my-3\",\"children\":[\"17.12 \",[\"$\",\"em\",null,{\"children\":\"Interpretation\"}],\". Headings and titles used in this Agreement are for reference purposes only and will not have any effect on the interpretation of this Agreement. The phrases \\\"including\\\", \\\"such as\\\", or \\\"or\\\" are not limiting.\"]}]\n9f:[\"$\",\"br\",null,{}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"a0:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm my-3\",\"children\":[\"17.13 \",[\"$\",\"em\",null,{\"children\":\"U.S. Government Customers\"}],\". This Section applies if Customer is a U.S. federal government entity. The terms used in this Section are defined in the Federal Acquisition Regulation and the Defense Federal Acquisition Regulation Supplement. The Cloud Services are provided to the U.S. Government as \\\"commercial items,\\\" \\\"commercial computer software,\\\" \\\"commercial computer software documentation,\\\" and \\\"technical data\\\", and are subject to this Agreement, with the same rights and restrictions generally applicable to the Cloud Services. If Customer or any Authorized User is using Cloud Services on behalf of the U.S. Government and these terms fail to meet the U.S. Government's needs or are inconsistent in any respect with federal law, Customer and such Authorized Users must immediately discontinue use of the Cloud Services. If greater rights are needed, a mutually acceptable written addendum specifically conveying such rights must supplement this Agreement.\"]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"a1:[\"$\",\"br\",null,{}]\na2:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm my-3\",\"children\":[\"17.14 \",[\"$\",\"em\",null,{\"children\":\"Conflicting Languages\"}],\". If this Agreement is made in the English language and any other local language, both versions are equally authentic. In the event of any inconsistency or differing interpretation between the different language versions, the English language version controls and the parties agree to amend the local language version to make it consistent with the English version.\"]}]\na3:[\"$\",\"br\",null,{}]\na4:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm my-3\",\"children\":[\"17.15 \",[\"$\",\"em\",null,{\"children\":\"Regional Terms\"}],\". Customer agrees to the following modifications to this Agreement if Customer's billing address is in the applicable region as described below:\"]}]\na5:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"kingdom-of-saudi-arabia\",\"className\":\"mt-8 mb-3 text-base w-fit font-semibold font-header hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#kingdom-of-saudi-arabia\",\"className\":\"anchor-link\",\"children\":[\"Kingdom of Saudi Arabia\"]}]}]\na6:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm my-3\",\"children\":\"A new Section 3.8 is added as follows:\"}]\na7:[\"$\",\"br\",null,{}]\na8:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm my-3\",\"children\":[\"3.8. \",[\"$\",\"em\",null,{\"children\":\"Communication, Space \u0026 Technology Commission’s Requirements\"}],\". Groq is not liable for Customer Data or content that violates applicable laws or infringes Intellectual Property Rights and reserves the right to remove or restrict access to such content upon lawful orders, without liability for resulting damages.\"]}]\na9:[\"$\",\"br\",null,{}]\naa:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm my-3\",\"children\":\"Groq’s rights to Inputs and Outputs in Section 4.2 (Inputs and Outputs) are amended as follows: “Groq does not access, use, store, or retain Inputs or Outputs unless necessary to provide the Cloud Services or comply with applicable law.”\"}]\nab:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"australia\",\"className\":\"mt-8 mb-3 text-base w-fit font-semibold font-header hover:underline\",\"children\":["])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#australia\",\"className\":\"anchor-link\",\"children\":[\"Australia\"]}]}]\nac:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm my-3\",\"children\":\"A new Section 13.2 is added as follows and Section 13 (Disclaimer of Warranties) is renumbered as Section 13.1:\"}]\nad:[\"$\",\"br\",null,{}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"ae:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm my-3\",\"children\":[\"13.2. This Section 13.2 applies only if the Cloud Services are subject to statutory guarantees under the Australian Competition and Consumer Act 2010 (“\",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"ACCA\"}],\"”). Applicable laws, including the ACCA, may confer rights and remedies into this Agreement that cannot be excluded, and which are not excluded by this Agreement. To the extent that the applicable laws permit Groq to limit their operation, Groq’s and its Affiliates’ Liability under those laws will be limited at its option, to the supply of the Cloud Services again, or payment of the cost of having the Cloud Services supplied again.\"]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"af:[\"$\",\"br\",null,{}]\nb0:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm my-3\",\"children\":\"Section 16.2 (Governing Law and Venue) is amended by inserting the following text at the end of that Section 16.2: “IF APPLICABLE LAW PREVENTS A DISPUTE FROM BEING RESOLVED IN A CALIFORNIA COURT, THEN CUSTOMER MAY FILE THE DISPUTE IN CUSTOMER’S LOCAL COURTS. IF APPLICABLE LAW PREVENTS CUSTOMER’S LOCAL COURT FROM APPLYING CALIFORNIA LAW TO RESOLVE A DISPUTE, THEN THE DISPUTE WILL BE GOVERNED BY THE APPLICABLE LOCAL LAWS OF CUSTOMER’S COUNTRY, STATE, OR OTHER PLACE OF RESIDENCE.”\"}]\nb1:[\"$\",\"br\",null,{}]\nb2:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm my-3\",\"children\":\"Section 17.10 (Entire Agreement) is amended by inserting the following text at the end of that Section 17.10: “Nothing in this Agreement excludes a party’s Liability for prior written or oral misrepresentation.”\"}]\nb3:[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"id\":\"18-resold-customers\",\"className\":\"[\u0026:not(:first-child)]:mt-12 mb-3 text-xl w-fit font-semibold font-header hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#18-resold-customers\",\"className\":\"anchor-link\",\"children\":[\"18. Resold Customers\"]}]}]\nb4:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm my-3\",\"children\":[\"This Section 18 (Resold Customers) applies only if (a) Customer orders Cloud Services from a Groq authorized unaffiliated third-party reseller under an active agreement with such reseller (such Cloud Services, “\",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Resold Services\"}],\"”), and (b) Customer is entering into this direct agreement with Groq to provision those Resold Services.\"]}]\nb5:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm my-3\",\"children\":\"18.1 Groq will provide to Customer the Resold Services described in the Order Form to the extent that there is a valid and binding order for such Resold Services between Groq and the authorized reseller. Groq may Suspend Cloud Services to Customer without Liability if at any time Customer or the reseller fails to maintain a billing account linked to its Account or with the reseller.\"}]\nb6:[\"$\",\"br\",null,{"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"}]\nb7:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm my-3\",\"children\":\"18.2 All prices for Resold Services will be solely determined between Customer and the reseller and all payment, billing, and invoicing terms under Customer's agreement with the reseller will prevail over this Agreement.\"}]\nb8:[\"$\",\"br\",null,{}]\nb9:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm my-3\",\"children\":\"18.3 If Groq's agreement with the reseller or Customer's agreement with the reseller is terminated or expires, then the Cloud Services will no longer be provided to Customer, unless Customer enters into an Order Form for the Cloud Services directly with, and pays the applicable Fees to, Groq in accordance with the terms of this Agreement.\"}]\nba:[\"$\",\"br\",null,{}]\nbb:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm my-3\",\"children\":\"18.4 Subject to Section 14 (Limitation of Liability), Groq will not be liable for damages under this Agreement to the extent Customer has claimed damages from the reseller in respect of the same event or series of events.\"}]\nbc:[\"$\",\"br\",null,{}]\nbd:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm my-3\",\"children\":\"18.5 Groq may share Customer Confidential Information, that does not include Customer Data, with the reseller subject to confidentiality obligations in this Agreement. Customer acknowledges and agrees that reseller may disclose Customer and Authorized User personal data to Groq as reasonably required for the reseller to handle any support issues that Customer escalates to or via the reseller.\"}]\nbe:[\"$\",\"br\",null,{}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"bf:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm my-3\",\"children\":\"18.6 At Customer's discretion, the reseller may access the Customer's Account. As between Groq and Customer, Customer is solely responsible for (a) any access by the reseller to Customer's Account; and (b) outlining any additional rights or obligations as between the Customer and the reseller with respect to the Resold Services. Groq will not have any Liability arising out of the reseller's (i) Suspension or termination of Customer's access to the Cloud Services; (ii) access to and visibility of Customer's Account and Customer's Account's billing information; (iii) offering or provisioning of reseller or third party products or services; or (iv) additional rights or obligations to Customer.\"}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"c0:[\"$\",\"br\",null,{}]\nc1:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm my-3\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Archived versions\"}]}]\nc2:[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"list-disc my-1 text-sm\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"ml-6 my-1.5 text-sm\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$Lca\",null,{\"prefetch\":true,\"href\":\"/docs/legal/archive/#groq-services-agreement\",\"children\":\"October 15, 2025\"}]}],\"\\n\"]}]\nc3:[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/css/ed0d2ab9f170a840.css\",\"precedence\":\"next\",\"crossOrigin\":\"$undefined\",\"nonce\":\"$undefined\"}]\nc4:[\"$\",\"$Lf1\",null,{\"children\":[\"$Lf2\",[\"$\",\"$Lf3\",null,{\"promise\":\"$@f4\"}]]}]\nc5:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[[\"$\",\"$Lf5\",null,{\"children\":\"$Lf6\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",null,{\"name\":\"next-size-adjust\",\"content\":\"\"}]],[\"$\",\"$Lf7\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$f8\",null,{\"fallback\":null,\"children\":\"$Lf9\"}]}]}]]}]\nc7:[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/css/e4f71bf329054e3a.css\",\"precedence\":\"next\",\"crossOrigin\":\"$undefined\",\"nonce\":\"$undefined\"}]\nc8:[\"$\",\"link\",\"1\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/css/7da1762454660603.css\",\"precedence\":\"next\",\"crossOrigin\":\"$undefined\",\"nonce\":\"$undefined\"}]\nc9:[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/css/8f8f35646157a18a.css\",\"precedence\":\"next\",\"crossOrigin\":\"$undefined\",\"nonce\":\"$undefined\"}]\n8:\"$0:f:0:1:2:children:1:props:children:1:props:params\"\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"cb:[\"$\",\"$Lca\",null,{\"prefetch\":true,\"href\":\"/docs/legal/customer-business-associate-addendum\",\"children\":\"BAA\"}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"cc:[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"ml-6 my-1.5 text-sm\",\"children\":[\"\\\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Confidential Information\"}],\"\\\" means information that one party (or an Affiliate) discloses to the other party under or in connection with this Agreement, and which is marked as confidential or would normally under the circumstances be considered confidential information. It does not include information that is independently developed by the recipient without using the discloser’s information, is rightfully given to the recipient by a third party without confidentiality obligations, or is or becomes public or generally available through no fault of the recipient. Subject to the preceding sentence, Customer Data is considered Customer's Confidential Information.\"]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"cd:[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"ml-6 my-1.5 text-sm\",\"children\":[\"“\",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Console\"}],\"\\\" means the online tool or dashboard provided by Groq to Customer for use in administering and using Cloud Services.\"]}]\nce:[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"ml-6 my-1.5 text-sm\",\"children\":[\"\\\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Customer Application\"}],\"\\\" means Customer’s applications, products, or services in which Customer may integrate the Cloud Services and AI Model Services as permitted by this Agreement.\"]}]\ncf:[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"ml-6 my-1.5 text-sm\",\"children\":[\"\\\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Customer Data\"}],\"\\\" means data provided to Groq by Customer or Authorized Users through the Cloud Services under the Account, and data that Customer or Authorized Users derive from that data through their use of the Cloud Services.\"]}]\nd0:[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"ml-6 my-1.5 text-sm\",\"children\":[\"“\",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Customer Indemnified Parties\"}],\"” means Customer and its Affiliates and their officers, employees, directors, agents, and representatives.\"]}]\nd1:[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"ml-6 my-1.5 text-sm\",\"children\":[\"\\\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Documentation\"}],\"\\\" means the then current Groq documentation (as may be updated from time to time) in the form generally made available by Groq to its Customers in the Console for use with the Cloud Services, including at \",[\"$\",\"$Lca\",null,{\"prefetch\":true,\"href\":\"https://console.groq.com/docs/overview\",\"children\":\"https://console.groq.com/docs/overview\"}],\".\"]}]\nd2:[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"ml-6 my-1.5 text-sm\",\"children\":[\"\\\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"DPA\"}],\"” or “\",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Data Processing Addendum\"}],\"” means the then current addendum to this Agreement published at \",[\"$\",\"$Lca\",null,{\"prefetch\":true,\"href\":\"https://console.groq.com/docs/legal/customer-data-processing-addendum\",\"children\":\"https://console.groq.com/docs/legal/customer-data-processing-addendum\"}],\" that d"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"escribes the data processing and security obligations with respect to Personal Data contained in Customer Data processed by the Cloud Services.\"]}]\nd3:[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"ml-6 my-1.5 text-sm\",\"children\":[\"“\",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Effective Date\"}],\"” means the date this Agreement is entered into by the parties, either by acceptance online, by signing an Order Form referencing the Agreement, or by signing the Agreement itself.\"]}]\nd4:[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"ml-6 my-1.5 text-sm\",\"children\":[\"\\\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"End Users\"}],\"\\\" means the end users of a Customer Application who are authorized by Customer to access or use the Cloud Services and AI Model Services through such Customer Application.\"]}]\nd5:[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"ml-6 my-1.5 text-sm\",\"children\":[\"\\\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Export Control Laws\"}],\"\\\" means all applicable export and re-export control laws and regulations, including (a) the Export Administration Regulations maintained by the U.S. Department of Commerce, (b) trade and economic sanctions maintained by the U.S. Treasury Department’s Office of Foreign Assets Control, and (c) the International Traffic in Arms Regulations (\\\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"ITAR\"}],\"\\\") maintained by the U.S. Department of State.\"]}]\nd6:[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"ml-6 my-1.5 text-sm\",\"children\":[\"\\\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Fee Accrual Period\"}],\"\\\" means a calendar month or other period or billing frequency specified by Groq in the Console or in an Order Form.\"]}]\nd7:[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"ml-6 my-1.5 text-sm\",\"children\":[\"\\\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Fees\"}],\"\\\" means the applicable fees for use of the Cloud Services and any AI Model Services. The Fees are published at \",[\"$\",\"$Lca\",null,{\"prefetch\":true,\"href\":\"https://groq.com/pricing/\",\"children\":\"https://groq.com/pricing/\"}],\", in the Console, or specified in an Order Form.\"]}]\nd8:[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"ml-6 my-1.5 text-sm\",\"children\":[\"“\",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"child"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"ren\":\"Groq’s APIs\"}],\"” means any application programming interface provided by Groq as part of the Cloud Services.\"]}]\nd9:[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"ml-6 my-1.5 text-sm\",\"children\":[\"“\",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Groq Contracting Party\"}],\"” means (a) Groq LLC for Customers domiciled outside the European Economic Area, Switzerland, or the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia; (b) Groq UK Limited for Customers domiciled in the European Economic Area or Switzerland; (c) Groq Limited for Customers domiciled in the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia; and (d) Groq Public Sector, LLC if designated on the Order Form.\"]}]\nda:[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"ml-6 my-1.5 text-sm\",\"children\":[\"“\",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Groq Indemnified Parties\"}],\"” means Groq and its Affiliates and their officers, employees, directors, agents, and representatives.\"]}]\ndb:[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"ml-6 my-1.5 text-sm\",\"children\":[\"\\\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"High Risk Activities\"}],\"\\\" means activities where the use or failure of the Cloud Services and the AI Model Services could reasonably be expected to lead to death, personal injury, or environmental or property damage (such as the creation or operation of nuclear facilities, air traffic control, life support systems, or weaponry).\"]}]\ndc:[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"ml-6 my-1.5 text-sm\",\"children\":[\"\\\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Indemnified Liabilities\"}],\"\\\" means any (a) settlement amounts approved by the indemnifying party; and (b) damages and costs finally awarded against the indemnified party by a court of competent jurisdiction.\"]}]\ndd:[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"ml-6 my-1.5 text-sm\",\"children\":[\"“\",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Input(s)\"}],\"” means any data submitted or prompts input into the AI Model Services by Customer or its Authorized Users. Inputs are Customer Data.\"]}]\nde:[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"ml-6 my-1.5 text-sm\",\"children\":[\"\\\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Intellectual Property Rights\"}],\"\\\" means current and future worldwide rights un"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"der patent, copyright, trade secret, trademark, and moral rights laws, and other similar rights.\"]}]\ndf:[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"ml-6 my-1.5 text-sm\",\"children\":[\"\\\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Liability\"}],\"\\\" means any liability, whether under contract, tort (including negligence), or otherwise, regardless of whether foreseeable or contemplated by the parties.\"]}]\ne0:[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"ml-6 my-1.5 text-sm\",\"children\":[\"\\\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Order Form\"}],\"\\\" means (a) an order form issued by Groq under this Agreement and executed with Customer; (b) an order placed by Customer via a Groq website, or (c) when purchasing from a reseller, the ordering document signed by Customer and the reseller, or through the reseller’s website that Customer uses to purchase the Cloud Services, in each case specifying the Cloud Services Groq will provide to Customer.\"]}]\ne1:[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"ml-6 my-1.5 text-sm\",\"children\":[\"\\\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Order Term\"}],\"\\\" means the period of time indicated on the Order Form and any renewal unless earlier terminated in accordance with this Agreement.\"]}]\ne2:[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"ml-6 my-1.5 text-sm\",\"children\":[\"“\",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Output(s)\"}],\"” means responses generated by the AI Model Services to Inputs. Outputs are Customer Data.\"]}]\ne3:[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"ml-6 my-1.5 text-sm\",\"children\":[\"\\\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Payment Due Date\"}],\"\\\" means the payment due date set out in the applicable Order Form, or if not specified, 30 days from the invoice date.\"]}]\ne4:[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"ml-6 my-1.5 text-sm\",\"children\":[\"“\",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Personal Data\"}],\"” has the meaning given in the \",[\"$\",\"$Lca\",null,{\"prefetch\":true,\"href\":\"/docs/legal/customer-data-processing-addendum\",\"children\":\"DPA\"}],\".\"]}]\ne5:[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"ml-6 my-1.5 text-sm\",\"children\":[\"“\",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"PHI\"}],\"” or “\",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Prote"])</s